            "review_title": "Review at King BBQ",
            "review_text": "DENIS C\nFontenay-sous-Bois, France1491 contributions\n0\nSurprisly good\nJul 2019 • Friends\nI was not expecting anything as the Korean BBQ is in a shopping center (TAKASHIMAYA) but surprisly it was very good with very decent service! Prices are also very reasonable . You can decide to cook yourself at the table which for my point of view is more fun or they can cook for you. Good serving !good if you are 6 or more\nWritten July 26, 2019",
